WEBVTT

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:38.950
Suicide...

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.960
Like I said, it's just a rumor.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.370
A rumor...

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:47.250
Kano was cheerful and everyone loved her,

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.260
but that attitude slowly changed.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.510
Did something happen?

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:56.550
I think Futaba was the main reason.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:57.600
Futaba?

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.720
Yeah... Didn't Kano tell you?

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.060
I've never heard of him.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.190
I see.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:08.150
Well, we didn't talk about those things.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:11.110
Futaba Senda, the club's vice president.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:15.070
He had a way with people--
knew how to charm 'em.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:18.530
I think a lot of the girls liked him.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:22.450
Sooner or later, he and Kano
became a thing.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:28.420
Hold up a sec. You're saying Kano
was going out with this guy?

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:29.540
Emergency Exit

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:35.180
Yeah. And he kept pushing the song
Kano picked out for the recital.

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:40.560
Maybe the girls were involved.
It started with playful teasing, but...

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.810
Huh?

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:45.390
What do you mean? They bullied her?

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.480
I don't know if they did or not,

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:52.860
but it felt like there might've
been something.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:58.660
In the video Urita showed us,
it didn't seem that way at all.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:02:59.950
Yeah.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:03.830
The unlisted videos aren't
the only ones out there.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:04.870
Huh?

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:08.540
Some were made private
after Kano's accident.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.550
That's something I've gotta see!

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:16.680
Yeah, all right. I can share 'em
with your account.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.430
Please do.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.680
Sorry for dragging you around.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:27.690
Nah. I decided to tag along on my own.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.190
Thanks.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.900
What's up?

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:41.530
It feels like... I never knew Kano at all.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.740
What Is This Pain?

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.740
Episode 6

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:47.580
You think that's what happened?
What will you do?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:53.880
If it's true she didn't die by accident,
I want to find out why.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:59.470
If it was bullying,
there won't be proof. It's bullying.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:04.640
You might not like what you learn
if you look into it.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:10.190
Even so, I've decided to think positive
and learn more about her.

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.400
Think positive...

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:12.310
Yes.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.480
Atta girl!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.320
Too close!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.490
I was wrong about you!

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.320
Thanks.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:21.240
That's the spirit!
If we don't think positive--

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:25.330
It won't be easy
winning Gauma to our side.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:30.040
Since they'll keep interfering,
shall we just kill them?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:34.750
Changing your mind?
That's what I said from the start.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.670
What do you think, Mujina?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.930
I'll do whatever we decide.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.340
I'm against it.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.970
Why's that?

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:48.520
Dynazenon might be why
<i>kaiju </i>keep appearing.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:54.610
It's easy enough to kill those guys,
but I wanna meet more <i>kaiju </i>first.

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:56.610
There's no rush?

00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:02.700
It'll be fine. The world is
heading in a good direction.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.490
What's up? You okay?

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.040
Not really.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.750
No, huh?

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:13.000
A girl I know...

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:17.760
She's confronting something tough
by not running away.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.510
Yeah, it's here.

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.470
You sure about this?

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:24.010
Check it out. Neat, huh?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.680
Whose could it be?

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:30.350
I wasn't sure what to do
when I found this,

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.270
but I wanted to show you at least.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:37.400
Uh... Th-This is a bad idea.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:41.900
Huh? It's fine.
No one else knows it's here.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.240
S-Sorry!

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.290
Hmm?

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.830
U-Um...

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.870
Maybe she's right...

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.250
What's bright?

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.000
Bright! Brighter than the sun!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.670
Hmm? Hey!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.550
Hey.

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:02.630
Huh?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:09.470
I had him swing by since he was close.
This is Arata. Uh, my husband.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.600
Oh. You're...

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:17.650
Hello. I'm Arata Tachibana. I run a shop
in Sanae. Nice to meet you.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:19.150
Uh, hello.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.900
Tiny table for three.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.490
Sure is.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:25.410
She always talks about you, Yamamoto.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.780
Yamanaka.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.990
Whoops. Sorry.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.080
It's fine.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.500
You've known her
since middle school, right?

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.580
Was she always like this?

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.460
Huh?

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:38.340
Having hometown pals is great.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:41.460
I still hang out with my old crew, too.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:41.460
Can we add tomatoes and skewers?

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.470
I haven't played futsal lately.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:45.430
Last week--

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:48.180
Do you work nearby, Yamamoto?

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:52.850
It's been fun. Thanks for coming.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.810
Let's hang out again.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.850
Y-Yeah.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.190
Someday, yeah.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.280
Senpai's late.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:16.920
What is this?

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:21.710
Yamamoto... Yamamoto... Yamamoto...

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.010
Who the hell's Yamamoto?

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:31.850
You're kidding!
Oh, my umbrella... I forgot it.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:40.060
Oh, shoot. Is that the enemy lady, or not?

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:43.280
In that outfit, it's gotta be her.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:47.240
But Gauma's not here, so why mess with me?

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:50.200
Then again, she was staring. But I'm not--

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.620
Oh. You're the Dynazenon--

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:55.870
K-Kaiju Eugenicist?!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.460
That's right.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.670
I'm starving.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:04.340
Are you... gonna... eat me?!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:05.960
Are you drunk?

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:10.340
Lately, Yomogi's made
some interesting friends!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.600
Is that right?

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:16.390
Like the one who came to eat with us.
Um, his name was...

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.260
Gauma?

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.480
Gauma!

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.770
You're so loud.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:26.070
He seems like such a good guy!
Doesn't he have a job doing something?

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.400
He's working part-time.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.480
Yeah?

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.570
Part-time?

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.620
Yomogi's working, too!

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.200
He'll need money for girlfriends!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.790
Any day now, right?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:43.170
Just so we're on the same page,
I don't have any money.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:44.800
I realize that.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.760
I don't have to pay?

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:48.670
Give it a rest.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.850
Why complain about marriage
and lead me on?

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:57.140
And then invite your husband?
What the hell?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.940
What am I even doing?

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.480
Beats me.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.770
Can't you phrase it a better way?

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:10.320
I don't know anything about you, Koyomi.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:14.660
I don't even know much about myself.

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:19.710
Unlike other people, I have nothing
I want to do. Not one.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.080
Well, I don't either!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.420
In that case, we're the same.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.470
Finally.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:42.810
Pre-Recital Pranking!!

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.770
Kanokano Edition

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:46.860
Minami! Come on in!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.060
She closed it!

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.990
--Where are you going?
--Come back!

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.910
Hey, Minami. Did you lose something?

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.070
Did you lose something?

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:58.240
Huh? What do you mean? Um, I don't know.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.280
I don't know

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.450
Well, maybe you should look.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.080
Kanokano's searching

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:06.630
Oh. My ankh puzzle's gone.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.830
MY ANKH PUZZLE'S...

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.710
MY ANKH PUZZLE'S...

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.710
GONE

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:07.960
SHE DISCOVERED!!!!!!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:11.260
Oh no! Look for it!

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.510
That voice...

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:13.550
SEARCHING IN THE MUSIC ROOM

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.470
C'mon!

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.930
It's raining, so hurry up!

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.760
Can't you give a hint?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.770
I did! I just did!

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:21.520
I did! I just did!

