00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:54.050
But everyone loved her
'cuz she was cheerful.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:02.100
Prank... success!

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:08.440
She really paid for it...

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:09.570
Hey!

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:11.780
It shouldn't be like this...

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.200
Why is it always like this?

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:21.080
I had money... I had tons of it.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:27.210
Kano's death wasn't an accident?

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:29.840
Yomo!

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.590
Where've you been?

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.710
He's just avoiding us.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.260
I've been busy.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.090
Working too much?

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.260
You haven't handed this in?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.470
Cut it out! Give it back!

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.380
Tiny letters!

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.390
It wouldn't fit!

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.020
Who needs two rows?

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:46.310
Yomoguilty!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.150
Yomoguilty?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:53.900
Senpai, you drinking
with married women again?

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.860
Who cares?

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:58.160
Ugh, I feel sick!

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.410
Aren't you going to training today?

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:06.370
No, there's no way.
Tell Gauma I can't make it.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:11.710
All right. But if you're not going,
lend me Dyna Striker.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.590
I'll go in your place.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:17.800
Huh?

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.640
Hmm?

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:20.840
It's gone.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:24.930
What?! You lost Dyna Striker?!

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:26.890
S-Sorry.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.810
Forgive him, please.
He feels bad about it.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.270
So?! Where and when did you lose it?!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.280
Uh, well...

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:38.860
He was drunk and can't remember.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:42.120
You can't just lose something like that!

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.290
It was stolen... by Mujina.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:48.290
Huh?

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.460
Mujina?!

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:52.710
What should I do with this?

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:57.010
Hey, hey, hey! It's a slice of Dynazenon!

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:57.970
Steal it?

00:12:57.970 --> 00:12:59.010
Mmm.

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:02.800
Nice work! Let's use it and wreck shit up!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:06.770
No, it's a valuable weapon of the enemy's.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:09.690
We could use it to
negotiate with Gauma and--

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:12.350
No. Let's give it back.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:17.480
It's not ours. What do you think, Mujina?

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.400
Huh?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.280
I...

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.740
Dynazenon is one body split into four.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.700
Oh?

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:32.170
My Dyna Diver can pinpoint Dyna Striker's
location, so let's take it back.

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:33.420
What about Yomogi--?

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.290
No time to waste!

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:38.670
We're raiding the enemy base!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:41.130
It's too dangerous for you.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.010
Eh?!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.850
Minami!

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:51.230
Did you ever watch the private video?

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:52.270
I did.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.650
Yeah? And?

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.190
I don't know.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:02.240
You couldn't tell if it was bullying?
Was it a gray area?

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.950
I'm telling you, I don't know.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:07.530
Maybe I could take a look.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:10.660
This has nothing to do with you.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:11.870
Huh?

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.880
We should use it to negotiate.

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:18.460
Are you stupid?!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:22.130
It'd be way more fun
wrecking shit in that thing!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:24.180
This isn't about fun.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:30.970
I don't care, so just decide already.
At this rate, I should've left it.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.600
There it is.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:35.940
Mujina stole it after all.

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.070
Koyomi, create an opening.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.860
Huh? How?

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.400
Do something crazy.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.910
Huh? Like what?

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:50.370
Figure it out yourself.
This is your fault.

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.870
Right...

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:56.540
In that case, we're the same.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.420
Argh, jeez!

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.100
Koyomi?!

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.480
Get off me!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:22.280
Nice one! Got it!

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:25.240
Access Mode... Dyna Striker!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.700
I said, get off!

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.290
Why are you here?!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.330
Sorry.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:45.130
Bring it on, Kaiju Eugenicists!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.800
Hey! This ain't good!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:47.970
Indeed.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:51.970
It's time to settle our 5,000-year grudge!

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.690
Wha--?! Damn!

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:03.110
They got away?! Shit! Lucky bastards!

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:07.110
That was a close one.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:10.160
I thought I was dead.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.410
There's always next time.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.080
Prank... succe--

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.300
What's wrong?

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:32.390
Something happen?

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.810
It's nothing.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:39.140
I see. Then I won't pry.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:40.890
It's just...

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.610
Hmm?

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:45.690
I wish life was easier.

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:49.910
Even strong people like you
think that, huh?

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.780
I'm far from strong.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:55.200
I think you're fine just as you are.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.620
If only it was that simple.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.880
It is. It really is simple.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.260
Sorry, I have to go.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:10.260
Mmm.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.400
Minami?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.110
What?

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:32.160
Was Sizumu here just now?

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.570
He was.

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:34.490
Did he--?

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.740
It was nothing.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.460
Something happen? Hmm?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.330
Another <i>kaiju</i>?

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:50.720
What's with this one?! I can't get it!

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:54.260
Mujina, help Onija out.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:56.310
Huh? Me?

00:17:56.310 --> 00:18:02.980
<i>Kaiju </i>must change for the world
to change. We must change, too.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.940
Is that what <i>kaiju </i>tell you?

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:12.780
<i>Kaiju </i>have a need for us.
Of course, Mujina, too.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:23.080
Instance Domination!

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:41.350
Hmm? We got it!

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.350
We did!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.850
It takes two to control it.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:48.610
Do it. Change the world with <i>kaiju</i>.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:55.360
I feel like I finally get it.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.700
What's up with you guys?

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.700
Nothing.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:04.000
Whatever. Let's go!

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:07.290
Access Mode... Dyna Soldier.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.290
Dyna Wing.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.260
Dyna Striker.

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:13.010
Dyna Diver!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.490
Here they come!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.870
We're gonna crush 'em!

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:04.640
Combine Dragon Dynazenon!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.850
Battle, Go!

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:14.110
Take this!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.450
Ow!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:35.550
Dynazenon! Is that all
the four of you got?!

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.840
Did your personality change?

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:41.140
Why's this thing so strong?!

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.390
No...

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:48.190
It's our power that's lacking!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:53.110
Get a grip, people! We'll be crushed!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:53.110
You don't think I know?!

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:56.820
Dyna Saber!

00:20:58.030 --> 00:20:59.990
Now!

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:03.910
Super Dragon Dyna Rex!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.840
It dodged!

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:20.220
Well, how about this?!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.790
Yeah, take that! Crush 'em, Mujina!

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:48.290
That was my plan!

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:53.000
Gauma, I wish we could've talked more
before it came to this.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:03.930
What the--?!

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:06.560
What the--?!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:13.810
A giant?!
